,kohaerenzprotokoll.scripts.judgements.renderrenderÿWrite the ledger as markdown, because qmd cannot see the ledger.

    qmd indexes `**/*.md` and nothing else ‚Äî 1047 files in the index, every one
    markdown, zero JSON. So `judgements.jsonl` and every `reconcile.json` are
    invisible to every search, which is the opposite of what they are for: they
    are the densest record of what has already been decided, and the thing most
    worth finding without re-reading.

    This is derived, never edited, and regenerated by `--render`. The `.jsonl`
    stays the source of truth: it is what `replay()` reads and what `trainset.py`
    trains on. @(m8Bc10f3f106f416d09HPR329bd1684f0be72eR4d0194b8a1cf02fdR740d5113158dc4ebRc2a3a995b6b7dac3Rc8f93ed166876dd0Rf2992b424bbfc027Rf8107c360edaff2aZint
